# Keep the demo fixture's Unity Packages manifest tracked. The generic
# `packages/` rule above also matches `Packages/` on case-insensitive
# filesystems, which would otherwise drop the fixture's Packages/ directory
# and break the reproducible static demo on a fresh clone.
!tests/fixtures/MinimalUnityProject/Packages/

